    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕdullo</span></b> , 1, v. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to fill with marrow</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cura nimia medullatos artus magni facit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 2, 16, p. 21, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quando ossa incipiunt medullari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Anim. 4, 5</span></i>
			; Ven. Carm. 3, 7 <i>fin.</i></div>
